---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { education } from '../data/experience';
---

<Section id="about" kicker="About" title="Who I am">
  <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr]">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-fg-muted [&_strong]:text-fg">
      <p>
        I&rsquo;m a recent <strong>Computer Science</strong> graduate from King Khalid
        University. My strongest ground is problem solving and algorithms &mdash; my
        team took <strong>1st place</strong> in the university&rsquo;s competitive
        programming competition &mdash; and I&rsquo;m most comfortable in Java, Python
        and C++.
      </p>
      <p>
        Over the last year I&rsquo;ve been moving into web development: building
        interfaces with HTML, CSS, JavaScript and Tailwind. Right now I&rsquo;m
        working through <strong>React</strong> and <strong>Node.js</strong>. This
        site is part of that &mdash; built with Astro and Tailwind, deployed as a
        static site.
      </p>
      <p>
        The direction I&rsquo;m heading is <strong>AI engineering</strong>: taking the
        CS fundamentals I have and learning how to build real systems around models.
        I work comfortably in both Arabic and English.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside
      class="h-fit rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 text-sm"
    >
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-fg">Education</h3>
      <dl class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-fg-muted">
        <div>
          <dt class="sr-only">Degree</dt>
          <dd class="text-fg">{education.degree}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="sr-only">School</dt>
          <dd>{education.school}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="sr-only">Period</dt>
          <dd>{education.period}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="sr-only">GPA</dt>
          <dd>GPA {education.gpa}</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Section>
